  "text": "STALE\n\n\nYOUTUBE SYNC\n\nThe allay came back empty-handed. It'll keep trying.\n\nYouTube counts haven't updated in 26 hours.\n\nThe site keeps showing the last good numbers. Nothing is on fire.\n\nLast good run yesterday.\n\nSee sync status http://localhost:3000/admin\n\nThe allay emails you because sync mail is on. Manage in Settings. http://localhost:3000/admin/settings\n— the allay. It'll keep trying. This usually fixes itself.",
  "html": "<!DOCTYPE html PUBLIC \"-//W3C//DTD XHTML 1.0 Transitional//EN\" \"http://www.w3.org/TR/xhtml1/DTD/xhtml1-transitional.dtd\"><html dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\"><head><link rel=\"preload\" as=\"image\" href=\"http://localhost:3000/brand/email/wordmark@2x.png\"/><meta content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\" http-equiv=\"Content-Type\"/><meta name=\"x-apple-disable-message-reformatting\"/><meta name=\"color-scheme\" content=\"dark\"/><meta name=\"supported-color-schemes\" content=\"dark\"/></head><body bgcolor=\"#0d131b\" style=\"background-color:#0d131b;margin:0;padding:0\"><!--$--><!--html--><!--head--><div style=\"display:none;overflow:hidden;line-height:1px;opacity:0;max-height:0;max-width:0\" data-skip-in-text=\"true\">The allay came back empty-handed. It&#x27;ll keep trying.<div> ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿</div></div><!--body--><table border=\"0\" width=\"100%\" cellPadding=\"0\" cellSpacing=\"0\" role=\"presentation\" align=\"center\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"margin:0;padding:0;background-color:#0d131b;font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;color:#eef1f6\"><table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellPadding=\"0\" cellSpacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" bgcolor=\"#0d131b\" style=\"background-color:#0d131b\"><tbody><tr><td align=\"center\" style=\"padding:32px 16px\"><table role=\"presentation\" width=\"600\" cellPadding=\"0\" cellSpacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" bgcolor=\"#151e29\" style=\"width:100%;max-width:600px;background-color:#151e29;border:2px solid #2c3a4b\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"padding:24px 28px;border-bottom:2px solid #2c3a4b\"><img alt=\"odsens\" height=\"20\" src=\"http://localhost:3000/brand/email/wordmark@2x.png\" style=\"display:block;outline:none;border:none;text-decoration:none\" width=\"84\"/></td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:28px;font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.6;color:#eef1f6\"><span data-email-badge=\"alert\" style=\"display:inline-block;background-color:#cc3a2a;color:#ffffff;border:2px solid #cc3a2a;padding:3px 8px;font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:11px;line-height:1.2;font-weight:bold;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:0.1em\">STALE</span><h1 style=\"margin:12px 0 0;font-family:Impact, &quot;Arial Black&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:22px;line-height:1.15;font-weight:normal;color:#ffffff;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:0.02em\">YouTube sync</h1><p style=\"margin:16px 0 0;font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.6;color:#9da9ba\">The allay came back empty-handed. It&#x27;ll keep trying.</p><p style=\"margin:16px 0 0;font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.6;color:#9da9ba\">YouTube counts haven&#x27;t updated in 26 hours.</p><p style=\"margin:16px 0 0;font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.6;color:#9da9ba\">The site keeps showing the last good numbers. Nothing is on fire.</p><p style=\"margin:12px 0 0;font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:13px;line-height:1.6;color:#9da9ba\">Last good run yesterday.</p><table role=\"presentation\" cellPadding=\"0\" cellSpacing=\"0\" border=\"0\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"padding-top:24px;vertical-align:middle\"><table role=\"presentation\" cellPadding=\"0\" cellSpacing=\"0\" border=\"0\"><tbody><tr><td bgcolor=\"#4b45d6\" style=\"background-color:#4b45d6;border:2px solid #4b45d6\"><a href=\"http://localhost:3000/admin\" data-email-button=\"indigo\" style=\"display:inline-block;padding:12px 22px;font-family:Impact, &quot;Arial Black&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:1;color:#ffffff;text-decoration:none;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:0.04em\">See sync status</a></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:20px 28px;border-top:2px solid #2c3a4b;font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:13px;line-height:1.6;color:#9da9ba\">The allay emails you because sync mail is on.<!-- --> <a href=\"http://localhost:3000/admin/settings\" style=\"color:#8b86f5;text-decoration-line:underline;font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:13px\" target=\"_blank\">Manage in Settings.</a><br/>— the allay. It&#x27;ll keep trying. This usually fixes itself.</td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table><!--/$--></body></html>"
